- `defines(v1, "Sort by Vendor or Amount?", {})`: The decision variable is defined with an empty range, failing to capture the options described in the text ("Sort Invoice by vendor", "Sort invoice by invoice amount").
- `branch(b1, XOR)`: Missing `guard` statements on the outgoing precedence edges to `n4` and `n5` to evaluate the sorting choice.
- `action(n11, "Set Up Hourly Collection")`: The model represents this as a single sequential action, failing to capture the recurring nature of the behavior described in the text ("The collection process will continue every hour until the end of the overall process").

